# The build context is `libs/`, not `libs/plane/`, because the plane image bakes the console
# bundle and a context cannot reach above itself. Both trees' exclusions therefore live here.
.git
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.log
**/*.md
!**/README.md

plane/tests

console/node_modules
console/dist

cli
operator
